    /// Attach the in-flight interaction session controllers for a node: a
    /// capture-phase press/release on value controls marks the drag session
    /// (suppressing inbound `VALUE`), and focus in/out on continuous-input
    /// widgets reports the session boundaries (`FOCUS_CHANGED` /
